#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/page_html/method.html.heex:134
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Source figures keep the terms of their source, listed above: cite the IMF, the World Bank, CEPII or the agency along with Syli Atlas. Stock prices are the exception: their source (MansaAPI) allows display on this site only, so they are not covered by this licence and may not be redistributed."
msgstr "来源数据适用上文所列各来源的条款：引用时请同时注明国际货币基金组织、世界银行、CEPII 或评级机构以及 Syli Atlas。股票价格除外：其来源（MansaAPI）仅允许在本站显示，因此不受本许可协议约束，不得再分发。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/components/layouts.ex:472
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Syli Atlas calculations: CC BY 4.0"
msgstr "Syli Atlas 计算内容：CC BY 4.0"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/page_html/method.html.heex:128
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What Syli Atlas computes and writes (regional and community totals, ranks, changes over a period, answer sentences, charts and share images) is under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 licence (CC BY 4.0): you may copy, adapt and republish it, commercial use included, as long as you credit Syli Atlas with a link to the page."
msgstr "Syli Atlas 计算和撰写的内容（区域和共同体合计、排名、某一时期的变化、问答文字、图表和分享图片）采用知识共享署名 4.0 许可协议（CC BY 4.0）：您可以复制、改编和重新发布，包括商业用途，只需注明 Syli Atlas 并附上页面链接。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:390
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{agencies}: %{verdict}, no. %{rank} of the %{of} African countries rated."
msgstr "%{agencies}：%{verdict}，在 %{of} 个获评级非洲国家中排第 %{rank}。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:432
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{count} countries"
msgstr "%{count} 个国家"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:159
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{gdp} in %{year} (IMF, current dollars): no. %{rank} of %{of} African economies."
msgstr "%{year} 年为 %{gdp}（国际货币基金组织，现价美元）：在 %{of} 个非洲经济体中排第 %{rank}。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:214
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{gdp} in %{year} according to the IMF projections, against %{now} in %{to}: real growth of %{avg} a year on average."
msgstr "根据国际货币基金组织预测，%{year} 年为 %{gdp}，%{to} 年为 %{now}：年均实际增长 %{avg}。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{name}: %{count} questions on the economy, answered"
msgstr "%{name}：%{count} 个经济问题及解答"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:94
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{term}: definition and figures for Africa"
msgstr "%{term}：定义及非洲数据"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:268
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{value} inhabitants in %{year} (IMF): no. %{rank} in Africa by population."
msgstr "%{year} 年人口 %{value}（国际货币基金组织）：按人口计非洲第 %{rank}。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:522
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{value} of the population in %{year} (World Bank)."
msgstr "%{year} 年占人口的 %{value}（世界银行）。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:311
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "1 euro = 655.957 francs, a fixed rate. Each zone has its central bank (BCEAO in Dakar, BEAC in Yaoundé), which sets one policy rate for all its members."
msgstr "1 欧元 = 655.957 法郎，为固定汇率。每个区域有自己的中央银行（达喀尔的 BCEAO、雅温得的 BEAC），为所有成员设定统一的政策利率。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:172
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A conversion that accounts for what money buys in each country, so that incomes can be compared in real terms."
msgstr "一种考虑货币在各国实际购买力的换算方法，以便按实际水平比较收入。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:275
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A deficit is financed by debt. The WAEMU and CEMAC set a ceiling of 3 % of GDP for their members."
msgstr "赤字靠举债弥补。西非经货联盟和中部非洲经货共同体为成员国设定了 GDP 3 % 的上限。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:281
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A deficit means the country needs foreign financing (investment, loans, aid); a surplus, that it lends to the rest of the world. Oil exporters swing with the price of crude."
msgstr "赤字意味着该国需要外部融资（投资、贷款、援助）；盈余则意味着它向世界其他地区放贷。石油出口国随原油价格波动。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:251
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A dollar buys more in Dakar than in New York: GDP per capita in PPP is therefore higher than at market exchange rates in most African countries. It is the better measure for comparing living standards; GDP in dollars is the better one for comparing the weight of economies."
msgstr "1 美元在达喀尔能买到的东西比在纽约多：因此在大多数非洲国家，按购买力平价计算的人均 GDP 高于按市场汇率计算的数值。它更适合比较生活水平；美元 GDP 则更适合比较经济体量。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:257
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A growth of 5 % means the economy produced 5 % more than the year before, at constant prices. With a population growing fast, GDP per capita grows less."
msgstr "增长 5 % 意味着按不变价格计算，经济产出比上一年多 5 %。人口增长较快时，人均 GDP 增幅会更小。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:208
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A rating of BBB− (Baa3 at Moody's) or higher: the debt is considered low risk, and most funds may buy it."
msgstr "BBB−（穆迪为 Baa3）或以上的评级：债务被视为低风险，大多数基金可以购买。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:263
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Above 10 %, it erodes incomes and savings quickly. In the two CFA franc zones, the peg to the euro keeps it low; elsewhere it often follows the exchange rate of the currency."
msgstr "超过 10 % 时会迅速侵蚀收入和储蓄。在两个非洲法郎区，与欧元挂钩使通胀保持在低位；在其他地方，通胀往往随本币汇率变动。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:453
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Africa, %{year}"
msgstr "非洲，%{year}"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:408
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "African countries rated"
msgstr "获评级的非洲国家"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:299
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Agencies then give the ratings SD, RD or D; CC and C mean a default is close. A default is followed by a restructuring negotiated with creditors, often with the IMF."
msgstr "此时评级机构会给出 SD、RD 或 D 评级；CC 和 C 表示接近违约。违约后通常会与债权人协商重组，往往有国际货币基金组织参与。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/components/profile_components.ex:850
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/area_html/questions.html.heex:11
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "All questions on the economy of %{name}"
msgstr "关于%{name}经济的全部问题"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:245
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An average, not what each person earns: inequality, measured by the Gini index, says how it is shared. Small countries with large oil or tourism revenues have the highest figures."
msgstr "这是平均值，不是每个人的收入：以基尼系数衡量的不平等反映其分配情况。石油或旅游收入丰厚的小国数值最高。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_html/show.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Answers written from the latest figures of the IMF, the World Bank, CEPII, the rating agencies and the IMF-World Bank debt analyses."
msgstr "答案依据国际货币基金组织、世界银行、CEPII、评级机构以及国际货币基金组织与世界银行债务分析的最新数据撰写。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:293
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Below, the debt is « speculative » (BB+ and lower): the country remains solvent but borrows more expensively, and many pension funds cannot hold its bonds."
msgstr "低于该水平，债务属于“投机级”（BB+ 及以下）：该国仍有偿付能力，但借贷成本更高，许多养老基金不能持有其债券。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:154
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "CFA franc"
msgstr "非洲法郎"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:411
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Default or close to it"
msgstr "处于或接近违约"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_html/show.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Details and sources"
msgstr "详情与来源"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:507
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Does %{name} have a stock exchange?"
msgstr "%{name}有证券交易所吗？"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:287
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each agency has its scale; Syli Atlas puts them on a common scale of 22 notches (AAA = 22, BBB− = 13, D = 1) to compare countries. A rating changes the cost at which a state borrows."
msgstr "各评级机构有各自的量表；Syli Atlas 将其统一为 22 级量表（AAA = 22，BBB− = 13，D = 1）以便比较各国。评级会改变一国的借贷成本。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:440
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Edition online"
msgstr "在线版本"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:378
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Fastest"
msgstr "最快"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:408
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Fixed rate: %{rate} %{code} for 1 %{anchor}."
msgstr "固定汇率：1 %{anchor} 兑 %{rate} %{code}。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:305
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Four levels: low, moderate, high, in debt distress. It covers only the countries eligible for the IMF's concessional loans; middle-income countries are not assessed."
msgstr "分为四级：低、中等、高、处于债务困境。仅涵盖有资格获得国际货币基金组织优惠贷款的国家；中等收入国家不在评估之列。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:166
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "GDP divided by the population: the average production per inhabitant, a measure of the level of income."
msgstr "GDP 除以人口：人均平均产出，衡量收入水平的指标。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:246
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "GDP per capita of %{value} in %{year}, %{verdict} (%{median}): no. %{rank} of %{of} in Africa per person (IMF)."
msgstr "%{year} 年人均 GDP 为 %{value}，%{verdict}（%{median}）：按人均计在非洲 %{of} 国中排第 %{rank}（国际货币基金组织）。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/components/layouts.ex:433
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:60
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:72
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:100
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:129
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_html/index.html.heex:6
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_html/index.html.heex:9
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_html/show.html.heex:7
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_html/show.html.heex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "术语表"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Glossary of African economies: GDP, debt, ratings, CFA franc"
msgstr "非洲经济术语表：GDP、债务、评级、非洲法郎"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:269
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Gross debt of the general government, as the IMF measures it. A level says little alone: its cost, its currency and its creditors (multilateral, China, bondholders) matter as much."
msgstr "国际货币基金组织口径的广义政府总债务。仅看规模说明不了太多：其成本、币种和债权人（多边机构、中国、债券持有人）同样重要。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:142
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Gross domestic product (GDP)"
msgstr "国内生产总值（GDP）"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:372
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:375
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:381
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:384
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:387
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:390
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Highest"
msgstr "最高"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:267
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How many people live in %{name}?"
msgstr "%{name}有多少人口？"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:155
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "IMF estimates and projections"
msgstr "国际货币基金组织的估计与预测"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:448
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In %{year}, mostly: %{products}. First client: %{client} (CEPII, BACI)."
msgstr "%{year} 年主要为：%{products}。第一大客户：%{client}（CEPII，BACI）。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:239
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In dollars, GDP also moves with the exchange rate: a fall of the currency lowers it even when the economy grows. That is why Syli Atlas shows real growth next to it. Source: IMF, World Economic Outlook."
msgstr "以美元计的 GDP 也会随汇率变动：即使经济增长，本币贬值也会使其下降。因此 Syli Atlas 同时显示实际增长。来源：国际货币基金组织《世界经济展望》。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_html/show.html.heex:23
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_html/show.html.heex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In figures, in Africa"
msgstr "数据看非洲"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:245
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Is %{name} a rich country?"
msgstr "%{name}是富裕国家吗？"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:311
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Is %{name} highly indebted?"
msgstr "%{name}负债严重吗？"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:376
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Is %{name} in default?"
msgstr "%{name}是否违约？"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:484
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Its companies are listed on the %{exchange}, the regional exchange shared by %{count} countries (%{listed} listed securities)."
msgstr "其企业在%{exchange}上市，该交易所为 %{count} 个国家共用的区域性交易所（%{listed} 只上市证券）。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:421
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Its currency: %{currency} (%{code})."
msgstr "其货币：%{currency}（%{code}）。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:369
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Largest"
msgstr "最大"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:372
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:375
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:381
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:384
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:387
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:390
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Lowest"
msgstr "最低"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:358
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Median of African countries, %{year}"
msgstr "非洲国家中位数，%{year}"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:367
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No rating agency rates it; the IMF and the World Bank put its risk of debt distress at « %{risk} » (%{date})."
msgstr "没有评级机构对其评级；国际货币基金组织和世界银行将其债务困境风险评为“%{risk}”（%{date}）。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:351
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No. Its rating is %{rating} (%{agencies})."
msgstr "否。其评级为 %{rating}（%{agencies}）。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_html/show.html.heex:44
#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_html/show.html.heex:45
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Other notions"
msgstr "其他概念"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:293
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Projection for %{year}: %{value}."
msgstr "%{year} 年预测：%{value}。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:312
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Public debt of %{value} of GDP in %{year}, against a median of %{median} in Africa: no. %{rank} of %{of} from the most indebted (IMF)."
msgstr "%{year} 年公共债务占 GDP 的 %{value}，非洲中位数为 %{median}：按负债程度由高到低在 %{of} 国中排第 %{rank}（国际货币基金组织）。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:190
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Public revenue minus public spending, in percent of GDP: negative when the state spends more than it collects."
msgstr "公共收入减公共支出占 GDP 的百分比：国家支出多于收入时为负值。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:144
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Purchasing power parity (PPP)"
msgstr "购买力平价（PPP）"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:54
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Questions on the economy of %{name}"
msgstr "关于%{name}经济的问题"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/country_questions_controller.ex:179
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Real GDP growth of %{growth} in %{year} (IMF estimate)."
msgstr "%{year} 年实际 GDP 增长 %{growth}（国际货币基金组织估计）。"

#: lib/syli_atlas_web/controllers/glossary_controller.ex:145
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Real growth"
